error[E0504]: the array 'b' must be given an array literal
 --> test-code/errors/x64/E0504-array-initializer-invalid.mu:5:5
  |
3 | main :: proc() Int ->
4 |     a := [2]Int { 1, 2 }
5 |     b : [2]Int = a
  |     ^ not an array literal
6 |     return 0
  |
  = note: an array is not copied, so it is defined with an array literal and is not assigned to as a
          whole
  = help: write an array literal, such as [const]Int { 1, 2 }
